=== lcf ===
DESCRIPTION ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Debian GNU/Linux lcf Revision: 3.00. This is free software; see the GNU
General Public Licence for copying conditions. There is NO warranty.


USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  lcf [options] dest_file src_dir


POSITIONALS (2) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  dest_file
  src_dir


FLAGS (5) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-h, --help         print this message
-s, --src-dir foo  foo Set the src dir (historical md5sums live here)
-d, --debug [n]    [n] Set the Debug level to N
-n, --no-action    Dry run. No action is actually taken.
-v, --verbose      Make the script verbose
